# Rhythm Roots handouts

Letter (8.5×11) HTML handouts in `handouts/`, printed to PDF via headless Chrome.

## Music notation (required)

Use **Bravura / SMuFL** outlines from `handouts/assets/notation/` — never hand-drawn ellipses, rect stacks, or scribble clefs.

- Card icons (`viewBox="0 0 80 56"`): `whole-note`, `half-note`, `quarter-note`, `eighth-note`, `quarter-rest` (`.d.txt` or `.path.svg`)
- Staff noteheads (staffSpace=14, centered at 0,0): `notehead-black`, `notehead-half` — place with `translate(x,y)` + stem rect; do **not** scale card-icon glyphs onto a staff
- Staff accidentals: `accidental-sharp` — center on pitch, ~1.25sp left of notehead
- Staff treble clef: `treble-clef-staff-kids.d.txt` / `treble-clef-staff-adult.d.txt`
- Fill with `#0d2b2a` (or `currentColor`); draw clef **under** staff lines
- Need a new symbol: extract from Bravura (SMuFL), add to `handouts/assets/notation/`, update `manifest.json`

```html
<!-- ✅ card glyph -->
<svg viewBox="0 0 80 56" aria-hidden="true">
  <path fill="#0d2b2a" d="…from quarter-note.d.txt…"/>
</svg>

<!-- ❌ cartoony placeholder -->
<ellipse cx="34" cy="38" rx="12" ry="9" fill="#0d2b2a"/>
```

## Layout & brand

Match existing handouts (Chromatic Scale, Parts of the Guitar, Rhythm):

- Fonts: Fraunces (display) + Outfit (sans)
- Colors: `--forest #0d2b2a`, `--terracotta #c45644`, `--sage`, `--ochre`, `--blush`, `--sand`, `--paper #faf7f1`
- Structure: logo header → eyebrow + title + lede → content → footer (tagline + rhythmroots.studio)
- Kids vs adult: friendlier copy + character mascot for kids; tighter language, no mascot for adult
- Fixed page: `width/height: 8.5in/11in`, `@page { size: letter; margin: 0 }`, `print-color-adjust: exact`

## Output

Ship `.html` + letter PDF (+ optional `.png` preview) in the handout folder. Relative assets via `../assets/`, `../characters/`.
